{"id":"potrebnost_","lemma":"потребность","pos":"noun","rank":4695,"glosses":["need, want","requirement"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/49/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B1%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B1%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"потребности","plural":"потребности"},"examples":[{"text":"В этом есть потребность.","en":"There is a need for that.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]},{"text":"Наши потребности изменились.","en":"Our needs have changed.","words":[{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null,{"g":"to change","l":"измениться"}]},{"text":"У нас разные потребности.","en":"We have different needs.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},null,null]},{"text":"Мы не можем удовлетворить ваши потребности.","en":"We can't meet your needs.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to satisfy"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null]},{"text":"Потребности многих перевешивают потребности нескольких.","en":"The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.","words":[null,null,null,null,null]}]}